      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1494,
        "height": 850,
        "content": "**1. Intake & Extract Data**\nReceives the invoice via webhook, extracts the PDF text, and uses AI to pull structured invoice data. Includes global error handling — any workflow failure sends an alert email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "df1752ee-37db-4a76-9883-b7f91f728032",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2288,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1430,
        "height": 938,
        "content": "**2. Validate, Analyze & Route**\nChecks required fields and duplicate invoices, uses AI to assess category/priority/risk, then routes to auto-approval, finance review, or manager approval based on amount and risk."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "783d6ce5-d438-4e33-97ac-50ec985425fb",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3760,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1136,
        "height": 722,
        "content": "**3. Approval & Storage**\nLow-risk, low-value invoices are auto-approved. Everything else waits for a human decision via webhook. Either way, the final record is stored in Google Sheets and finance gets a confirmation email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e74cac57-02f9-4206-8040-7f27805013f5",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -16,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#F2CC64",
        "width": 716,
        "height": 856,
        "content": "## **AI Invoice Processing and Approval Automation**\n\n**Who it's for:** Any finance/accounts-payable team that wants invoices validated, risk-checked, and routed for approval automatically instead of manually.\n\n**What it does:** Takes an incoming invoice (PDF), extracts structured data with AI, checks for missing fields and duplicates, assesses risk, and either auto-approves it or routes it to the right human approver — logging every outcome to Google Sheets.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Invoice PDF is submitted via webhook\n2. AI extracts invoice number, vendor, amounts, line items, and payment info\n3. Missing required fields trigger an email back to the vendor\n4. Duplicate invoices are flagged and finance is notified, not processed for payment\n5. AI assesses category, priority, and risk level\n6. Low-value/low-risk invoices auto-approve; everything else goes to Finance or a Manager for review\n7. The approver's decision resumes the workflow via webhook\n8. The final record is stored in Sheets and finance gets a confirmation email\n\n**How to set up**\n☐ Connect Gmail (for all outgoing emails)\n☐ Connect OpenAI (used for both AI extraction and analysis steps)\n☐ Connect Google Sheets and replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` with your own sheet\n☐ Replace the placeholder `@yourcompany.com` addresses with your real team inboxes\n☐ Build the approval webhook/page that posts back to the Wait node with a decision\n\n**CUSTOMIZATION**\n- Change the auto-approval threshold (default: $1000, low risk, no mismatch)\n- Adjust required fields or the AI extraction schema\n- Change who reviews high-risk vs. high-value invoices"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
